---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base
  title="Legal Notice (Impressum)"
  description="Legal notice (Impressum) under Section 5 of the German Digital Services Act (DDG)."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="display page-title">Legal Notice</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">Impressum</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <div class="wrap prose-body">
      <h2>Information under Section 5 DDG</h2>
      <p>
        Alexander Jaeger<br />
        Wolfenbütteler Str. 17<br />
        30519 Hannover<br />
        Germany
      </p>

      <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
      <p>E-mail: <a href="mailto:contact@leonidaracing.com">contact@leonidaracing.com</a></p>
      <p>This address is also our point of contact for users and for authorities under Articles 11 and 12 of the EU Digital Services Act. You can write to us in English or German.</p>

      <h2>Responsible for content under Section 18(2) MStV</h2>
      <p>Alexander Jaeger, address as above.</p>

      <h2>Liability for content</h2>
      <p>As a service provider, we are responsible for our own content on these pages under general law (Section 7(1) DDG). Under Sections 8 to 10 DDG, however, we are not obliged to monitor third-party information that is transmitted or stored, or to look for circumstances that indicate illegal activity.</p>
      <p>Obligations to remove or block the use of information under general law remain unaffected. Liability in this respect only begins when we become aware of a specific infringement. As soon as we learn of such infringements, we will remove the content without delay. You can report content via <a href={`${base}report-content/`}>Report content</a> or by e-mail.</p>

      <h2>Liability for links</h2>
      <p>This site contains links to external third-party websites (e.g. Discord and linked community servers). We have no influence on their content and therefore cannot accept any liability for it. The respective provider or operator is always responsible for the content of linked pages.</p>

      <h2>Copyright</h2>
      <p>Content and works created by the site operator on these pages are subject to German copyright law. Contributions by third parties (e.g. submitted screenshots) are marked as such.</p>

      <h2>Relationship to Rockstar Games / Take-Two Interactive</h2>
      <p>This website is a private, non-commercial, independent community project and has no connection to Rockstar Games, Take-Two Interactive Software or their affiliates. Game titles, trademarks, screenshots and other game content remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .page-title { margin: .6rem 0 .5rem; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem); }
  .page-lede { color: var(--gh-muted); font-size: .92rem; }

  .prose { padding-bottom: var(--gh-gap-section); }
  .prose-body { max-width: 62ch; }
  .prose-body h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 2rem 0 .6rem; }
  .prose-body h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .prose-body p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--gh-muted); font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose-body a { color: var(--gh-yellow); }
</style>
